    [Doc][Model] Update Eagle3 draft model download link in Qwen3-30B-A3B tutorial (#17152)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Update the Eagle3 draft model download link in the Qwen3-30B-A3B
    tutorial to `AngelSlim/Qwen3-a3B_eagle3`, so users can obtain the
    correct draft model for speculative decoding.
    
    Fixes #17075
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. Documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Documentation-only change. Verified the updated Hugging Face URL and
    that the rest of the tutorial is unchanged.
    
    
